old of living things, the corrupting influence of the Darklight extends its reach to unliving entities. Stones and crystals, once dormant and lifeless, become animated by the unholy fusion of darkness and light. The Darklight Constructs stand as twisted embodiments of this corrupted union, their forms bearing the scars of their transformation. Veins of pulsating, malevolent energy traverse their stony bodies, emanating an eerie glow that casts haunting shadows in their wake. These constructs, infused with an unholy sentience, wield their newfound powers with an unsettling grace, becoming relentless agents of destruction under the influence of the darklight's corruptive touch.</p></blockquote>\n<div class=\"webdesc-from\" style=\"float: right; margin: 0 2em 0 0;\">—Tibia Library</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-center wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"4312576280fe2ac417ea99da9a9e785b\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:187px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Dark_Energy_Construct_Artwork-jpg\" style=\"position: relative; height:185px; width:152px;\"><img alt=\"Official Creature Artwork\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Official \" height=\"185\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Dark_Energy_Construct_Artwork_e02b04.jpg\" style=\"\" title=\"Dark Energy Construct Artwork.jpg (225 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Official Creature Artwork</div></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\">Unknown.</div>\n<div style=\"clear:l